    "description": {
      "value": "<p>This feature replaces the Paladin's Restoring Touch feature. When you deal damage with Death Coil, the target takes extra Necrotic damage equal to your Charisma modifier (minimum of 1), whether or not it fails its save. If the target is Undead and you have it regain Hit Points, it regains additional Hit Points equal to your Paladin level.</p>",
